1. TRANSFER ACTION AND UI
==================================================

Add a “Transfer to Another Team” action for authorized users.

Preferred locations:

- Goal detail page action menu
- Goal edit page, where appropriate
- Optional row action in the Goals table if consistent with the current application design

Do not expose the action to users who do not have permission.

When the user selects “Transfer to Another Team”, open a confirmation modal or drawer.

