8. PERMISSIONS
==================================================

Use the existing permission model.

Validate at least:

- Super Admin
- Team Admin
- Goal owner
- Normal team member
- Viewer/read-only user
- User who is not a member of the current team
- User who is not a member of the target team

Expected safe behaviour:

Super Admin:
- Can transfer goals according to global administrative permissions.

Team Admin:
- Can transfer goals only when authorized for the source and target teams according to the current permission model.

Normal user:
- Must not transfer a goal unless the current business rules explicitly permit it.

Viewer/read-only user:
- Must not transfer a goal.

Backend requirements:

- Never trust a client-supplied user ID, role, or permission flag.
- Use the authenticated user.
- Verify source-team authorization.
- Verify target-team authorization.
- Verify access to the goal.
- Verify owner-team membership.
- Verify goal-level compatibility.

An unauthorized direct API request must return 403.

