12. ERROR HANDLING
==================================================

Handle these cases safely:

- Goal does not exist: 404
- Source team does not exist: 404
- Target team does not exist: 404
- Target team is inactive or archived: 400 or 409
- User is unauthorized: 403
- Current owner is not a target-team member: 400 or 409
- Invalid target-team goal level: 400
- Target team equals current team: 400
- Goal was modified by another user: handle according to existing concurrency pattern
- Goal was deleted during transfer: 404 or conflict
- Network failure
- Database failure
- Audit-history failure
- Invalid or missing request values
- Null or malformed team/owner/level data

The UI must not crash or show a successful state when the transfer fails.

