ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
==================================================

The feature is complete only when:

- An authorized user can transfer a goal to another eligible team.
- The target team cannot be the same as the current team.
- The current owner is eligible in the target team, or an approved eligible owner is explicitly selected.
- The target team allows the selected goal level.
- The goal keeps the same ID.
- Existing related data is preserved.
- Public/private visibility remains correct.
- Unauthorized users cannot transfer through UI or API.
- The goal disappears from the previous team and appears under the target team.
- Transfer history is recorded.
- Transfer survives refresh and re-login.
- Loading and error states work correctly.
- Duplicate requests cannot cause data corruption.
- Existing goal, team, permission, and visibility features are not broken.
- No unrelated schema or files are changed unnecessarily.
